    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nNeovim's motions `e`,  `b` and `w` sucks for `snake case` unless and until you do `:set isKeyword-=_`.\nBut what about when you found that there is now way to get to the end of current string beacuse all the lower case motions are now considering `_`.\n\nWatch the video to know why upper case motion sucks in this modern age.\n\nMy issue in a nutshell is simple:  \nNeovim must have to support surgical motions for standard cases such as snake and camel.\n\nSorry, if my there was any issue with gammer or formatting.\n\nWatch the video to easily understand why am I rasing this issue.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ba01f98-af2c-4cd5-a20b-de0720d8937e\n\n\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nAs expected, a toggleable bhevaiour to keep both the old and modern motions and leave it for the user to pick one of them.",
