            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This was discussed previously, search closed issues.\n\nWe do have plans for treesitter-driven textobjects, plus other tracking issues: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues?q=state%3Aopen%20label%3A%22op-textobjects%22\n\nAnd there are several very capable plugins like https://github.com/wellle/targets.vim , you haven't explained why that needs to be in core.\n\nMeanwhile, slapping \"modern\" in front of something isn't a mic drop. There are are about 1000 things more urgent for core to focus on.\n",
